  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0: Adds a net11.0 build. net8.0 and net9.0 stay for now, although .NET 8 and 9 left support on 10 November 2026; a later release will drop them, and apps on .NET 8 and 9 will then get the netstandard2.0 build, which brings the System.Text.Json package with it. The netstandard2.0 build, which .NET Framework 4.6.2 and later use, now depends on System.Text.Json 10.0.14 instead of 10.0.13, with Microsoft.Bcl.AsyncInterfaces, System.IO.Pipelines and System.Text.Encodings.Web 10.0.14. No change to the library's code; net8.0, net9.0, net10.0 and net11.0 depend on no package.",
